# Model Policy

- This project only uses two Anthropic model families: **Sonnet** and **Haiku**.
- Never use Opus or any other model family.
- **Sonnet** (`claude-sonnet-4-6`): all 5 agent pipelines (ingestion, analysis, benchmark, gap, leads).
- **Haiku** (`claude-3-5-haiku-latest`): simple classification only (e.g. franchise detection).
- Use `callSonnet()` and `callHaiku()` from `backend/anthropic.js` — never call the Anthropic API directly with other models.
